Virgin Territory is a adventure, action, comedy film directed by David Leland.

3
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:36,000
In Black Death era Tuscany, as in the Decameron, ten young
Florentines take refuge from the plague.

4
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:46,000
But instead of telling stories, they have lusty adventures, bawdy exchanges,
romance, swordplay, randy nuns, Saracen pirates, and a sexy cow.

