11
00:56:50,000 --> 00:56:56,000
Virgin Territory is a 2007 romantic comedy film directed by David Leland.

12
01:02:00,000 --> 01:02:06,000
It was the last film produced by Dino De Laurentiis.

13
01:07:10,000 --> 01:07:16,000
The film stars Hayden Christensen, Mischa Barton, Tim
Roth, Rosalind Halstead and
Kate Groombridge.

14
01:12:20,000 --> 01:12:26,000
It is based upon Giovanni Boccaccio's 14th-century tale The Decameron.

15
01:17:30,000 --> 01:17:36,000
The film was released in France on December 12, 2007.

16
01:22:40,000 --> 01:22:46,000
